            "review_title": "Review at Papas' Chicken & Beer",
            "review_text": "William L\nGreer, South Carolina59 contributions\n0\nAbsolutely horrible\nAug 2016 • Family\nLiving in the neighborhood and passing by Papa's Chicken & Beer for the past several years, I was reluctant to try it because it never seemed to be busy. Last night my wife and I had a taste for something different, and based on one or two reviews we decided to order two dishes. \n\nThe Chicken and Cheese was a mess of chicken thighs, and legs cut randomly with no regard to bone or knuckle removal topped with a heavy funky tasting melted cheese that has no business being served with chicken. \n\nThe second dish was their recommendation, which was equally as bad. We took a couple of bites and threw both in the trash at the tune of 350,000 VND. \n\nMy recommendation is to avoid Papa's Chicken & Beer\nRead more\nValue\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 25, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
