            "review_text": "Man T\nDa Nang, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nBest chicken ever\nApr 2016 • Friends\nThere are not many chicken store in my hometown (just only fastfood restaurant like KFC or Lotteria), therefore Papa's Chicken, a restaurant serving chicken in Korea style is absolutely strange to me. This was my first time trying Korea chicken and it was totally good. My favorite is chicken and cheese. Nice restaurant!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 19, 2016",
