            "review_title": "Review at Papas' Chicken & Beer",
            "review_text": "Missuspoons\nMartinsville, New Jersey18 contributions\n0\nGo for the Korean Fried Chicken + Beer\nApr 2016 • Couples\nBeing from California, we have many excellent Korean Fried Chicken joints locally. This one is not bad, though perhaps not the best you'll get. I appreciate that they allow you to purchase full and half portions (so you can try more variety), and the draght beer is very affordable (I believe it was Sapporo on tap). They do give you the free pickled vegetables and coleslaw typical of all Korean Fried Chicken places. Hubby and I tried one instant noodle dish on the menu and it was incredibly average, bordering on sub-par. Next time we will just stick to the chicken!\nRead more\nWritten April 19, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
