            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n0\n100% better than KFC; Koreans do their chicken right.\nJun 2015 • Couples\nKoreans are famous for their fried chicken. The plain fried, the fried with soyu sauce, sweet & sour, spicy, cajun, cheese... the list goes on. The sauce is always a little sticky and the chicken moist so you almost want to finish everything, bones included. Boy are you missing out on the REAL finger lickin' good chicken if you haven't tried this one out before! And compared to the many other Korean chicken shops in the area, Papas' is probably one of, if not the best.\n\nThey apparently have lots of other foods good with beer (explains their name ain't it) but their chicken is absolutely the best. This place is always crowded. Best to order delivery so you can eat a mess out of it and nobody knows.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 18, 2016",
